# Internal quote calculator

The only quote calculator lives at **`/internal/quote-calculator`**.

## Single source

- Component: `src/components/internal/InternalQuoteCalculator.jsx`
- Local deps: `src/components/internal/quote-calculator-lib/**`
- Route: `src/app/internal/quote-calculator/**`

## Isolation rules

- Do **not** import `InternalQuoteCalculator` (or its lib) from public/marketing pages.
- Public pages use static pricing (`ResidentialPricingGuide`), not a live calculator.
- Do **not** recreate parallel calculators under `src/components/residential/` or `src/components/ppc/`.

## Shared pricing labels only

Published “Starting at” tiers for the public pricing guide live in `src/lib/startingAtPricing.js` and may be read by the internal calculator for helper copy. Do not move calculator math back into shared public modules.
